{command} [global] show|add|del|access|state|enable|disable|bold
Custom alias system - runs actions automatically off chat events (join, message, kick, ban, etc).
*/ show <name> <event> [bold]          - view one alias in detail
*/ add <name> <event> <cond> <action>  - add a new alias for an event
*/ add <name> macro <command> [body]   - add a new macro / command shortcut
*/ access <name> <level>               - change a macro's access level
*/ del <name> <event>                  - delete an alias
*/ state                               - see whether the alias system is on or off
*/ enable / disable                    - turn the whole alias system on or off (access 8)
*/ bold                                - list every alias, compact (raw) format
Put 'global' in front to manage aliases that apply in every room (access 7).
Without it you only manage aliases for this room. See also: help macro
